message: "If you use this toolkit, please cite this software and the associated dissertation."
type: software
title: "Agent Evaluation Toolkit"
version: "0.4.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/brunomfernandes45/agent-eval-toolkit"
url: "https://github.com/brunomfernandes45/agent-eval-toolkit"
authors:
  - family-names: "Fernandes"
    given-names: "Bruno Miguel Lopes da Rocha"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Research toolkit accompanying Measuring Productivity Impact in Enterprise
  Agentic AI Architectures. Evaluates workflow-run telemetry with explicit
  evidence tiers, metric denominators, mapping readiness, privacy controls,
  and auditable evaluation packages. Verification uses synthetic fixtures
  and establishes bounded conformance rather than enterprise effectiveness.
keywords:
  - agentic AI
  - workflow evaluation
  - telemetry
  - design science research
  - reproducibility
